    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span><span class=\"time\">40 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip bad\">Hard</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Greedy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Two passes</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/candy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 135</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Candy</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Two neighbour rules, two passes: left-to-right enforces \"beat your left neighbour\", right-to-left enforces \"beat your right neighbour\" while keeping the larger value. Each child gets the longer of its two slopes. O(n) time; O(1) space if you count slopes instead of storing them.</p>\n"
